{"meta":{"id":"cee:21000","type":"series","name":"شما في البراري الخضراء","poster":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/42D668D0-D9A3-C03D-7428-14359E151E34_poster.jpg","background":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/42D668D0-D9A3-C03D-7428-14359E151E34_poster.jpg","description":"Anne is an orphan full of imagination. When she arrives at her new home she learns that sometimes you have to be a sensible person too; at the same time her unique character changes, or at least attracts, the people around her. The story covers Anne's growth from about eleven to seventeen years old as she makes friends, goes to school and studies. At a difficult point in her life, Anne will have to make a hard choice and perhaps find a new dream.","releaseInfo":"1979","genres":["رسوم متحركة","دراما","تاريخي"],"cast":["nostaff","nostaff"],"director":[],"imdbRating":"7.5","runtime":"26 min","videos":[{"id":"cee:21000","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 1","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/42D668D0-D9A3-C03D-7428-14359E151E34_poster.jpg","released":"1979-01-01T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:21001","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 2","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/42D668D0-D9A3-C03D-7428-14359E151E34_poster.jpg","released":"1979-01-02T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:21002","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 3","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/42D668D0-D9A3-C03D-7428-14359E151E34_poster.jpg","released":"1979-01-03T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:21003","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 4","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/42D668D0-D9A3-C03D-7428-14359E151E34_poster.jpg","released":"1979-01-04T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:21004","title":"الموسم 1 - الحلقة 5","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://cnth2.cee.buzz/vascin-poster-images/42D668D0-D9A3-C03D-7428-14359E151E34_poster.jpg","released":"1979-01-05T00:00:00.000Z"},{"id":"cee:2100